B. GRPO Fine-tuning Result
Both prior work [16] and our preliminary experiments
suggest that sampled Chain-of-Thought (CoT) prompting does
not effectively activate the spatial reasoning capabilities of
vision-language models (VLMs). Therefore, in this work, we
adopt a ”No-Thinking” strategy, where the model is trained
to directly generate the final answer without intermediate
CoT reasoning. We fine-tuned the PaLI-gemma2-3B-mix-224
model [26] using two GRPO configurations, summarized in
Table II.
